{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are a top-class elite hacker.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There is no place your virus cannot reach.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Challenge, experiment, and advance!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Hacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must tailor the virus to the target computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the virus fails to reach the computer during the attack, you cannot hack it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/9fa887bb8e91b94a4aaf56782819fc3a.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Springs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place springs along the virus\u2019s trajectory you imagine to design its path and carry out the hack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re free to use the springs however you like \u2014 stairs, walls, launchers, centrifuges, etc. \u2014 as long as it accomplishes the hack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/7d63859a5ed109701ed3c4e2995cdca0.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. No Single Answer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single right answer in hacking. Always prioritize adapting the virus to the target computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through repeated design, experiments, and challenges, steadily move closer to the correct solution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the truth \u2014 the answer and the solution. I support your challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/3f9cf15aed567da28fea50466b136506.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Various Obstacles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the obstacles that block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid multiple viruses, lasers, gravity, and surface gravity by any means necessary to achieve your hack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/86071843cd4d983bdaab6d147f52e6f7.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5. The Fun of the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Computer viruses can be solved through trial and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated failures will inevitably lead to success\u2014keep pushing forward endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game where all you need to do is hack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking with no fixed answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle that brings you closer to the solution with every failure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles and gimmicks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confidence and a sense of accomplishment in solving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in single-player mode only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both English and Korean GUI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers 8 chapters and 56 stages, providing about 3\u20134 hours of playtime.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hack more creatively \u2014 share your hacks!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Think, experiment, try, and prove that your way is the right way!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971810?t=1758858657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971810?t=1758858657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/9994c465db7ef5891c17a40b7bd4ccb2bf97ed24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758858657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/9994c465db7ef5891c17a40b7bd4ccb2bf97ed24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758858657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You are a top-class elite hacker.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>There is no place your virus cannot reach.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Challenge, experiment, and advance!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Hacking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must tailor the virus to the target computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the virus fails to reach the compute