ial and experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeated failures will inevitably lead to success\u2014keep pushing forward endlessly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.poster.avif?t=1758858657\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.webm?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971810/extras/924748e87bf08f1552d515464dbbd32d.mp4?t=1758858657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the end,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple game where all you need to do is hack!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hacking with no fixed answers!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A puzzle that brings you closer to the solution with every failure!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles and gimmicks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confidence and a sense of accomplishment in solving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Version,</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in single-player mode only.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports both English and Korean GUI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offers 8 chapters and 56 stages, providing about 3\u20134 hours of playtime.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hack more creatively \u2014 share your hacks!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Think, experiment, try, and prove that your way is the right way!</strong></h2>","developers":["Hitta